### Architectural Context Passing
- **Upstream Agents** (Architects, BAs, Ticket Creators): Must read global architecture (docs/vision.md, docs/components.json) and embed relevant local architecture into the tickets they create.
- **Downstream Agents** (Coders, Testers): Must strictly follow the architectural constraints provided in the ticket and reject tickets that lack sufficient context.
